      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is understandable that you feel overwhelmed and that the physical struggle is deeply connected to how you feel emotionally. Please try to be gentle with yourself regarding your body and the effort it takes just to exist right now. While I am an AI and cannot offer medical advice, please consider that these feelings of being a burden are often symptoms of distress, not facts about your worth. If you are in crisis, please know there are immediate, compassionate people ready to listen right now.",
