      "content": "Losing a sense of control over your own life and body can feel like a profound loss of self, and that feeling of helplessness is incredibly painful. It sounds like your need for dignity and self-autonomy is deeply important to you right now. Even small ways to maintain a sense of control can help, such as carefully choosing what you read or what you watch. Please consider if there are any small moments you can intentionally choose for yourself today, no matter how small they are.",
